## Test chunks (cloud turns time out; never run the whole suite)

Never run `pytest tests` or `pytest tests/stage1` bare in a cloud turn — `tests/stage1`
alone takes ~50 min with `slow` deselected. Run named chunks, each wrapped in
`timeout 600`; if a chunk hits the timeout, report it as `BLOCKED` on #46, do not retry.

| Chunk | Command (from `code/proteus`, `PYTHONPATH="src:$PWD" pipenv run …`) | Who runs it |
|---|---|---|
| `gate` | `pytest tests/stage1/test_level_set.py tests/stage1/test_scale_search.py tests/stage1/test_recursion.py -q -p no:cacheprovider --deselect tests/stage1/test_recursion.py::test_mst_critical_hollow_contrast_vs_h_and_conj` (~15 s) | every worker before `DONE`; A1 on every merge |
| `foundation` | `pytest tests/foundation tests/properties tests/reductions tests/contracts -q -p no:cacheprovider` (~10 s) | A1 on every merge |
| `evidence` | `pytest tests/evidence tests/stage1/test_dm_cluster.py tests/stage1/test_edge_evidence.py -q -p no:cacheprovider` (~3 s) | A1 on every merge; A2 before `DONE` |
| `scenarios` | `pytest tests/scenarios tests/inference tests/diagnostics tests/stage2 -q -p no:cacheprovider` (~60 s) | A1 on every merge; A4/A5 before `DONE` |
| `persistence` | `pytest tests/stage1/persistence -q -p no:cacheprovider --durations=40` (~45 min full; default smoke is `persistence/test_core_smoke.py` only) | **A6 only** (#46 / A6-T4–T5); A1 skips the full slow tree |

